{
  "_comment": "Match-size to power thresholds are data-driven. Evaluated from highest min_size down; the first threshold whose min_size <= group size wins. `count` (default 1) is how many power tiles that group size creates -- a very large connection legitimately earns multiple powers from one real move, which can then interact with each other during the cascade (see ChainResolver). Ladder: bomb(4) -> lightning(5) -> freeze(6) -> chain(7/9/12, count 1/2/3).",
